      "title": "ISAcreate Galaxy tool for prospective data management with ISA format support \u2013 application to metabolomics datasets",
      "abstract": "<ns3:p>The ISAcreate Galaxy tool is a new component developed as part of the European Union\u00a0 Horizon 2020 PhenoMeNal project (https://phenomenal-h2020.eu) to help the reporting of experimental data. Built around the ISA syntax and the soon to be available as a native Galaxy datatype, ISAcreate enables the creation of ISA-compliant archives, ready for deposition to prime repositories such as EMBL-EBI MetaboLights.</ns3:p>",
